        "thought_text": "Instead of using a set to precompute all possible sums, which can be inefficient for large inputs, we should use dynamic programming to find the minimum number of coins needed for each possible sum up to the maximum query value. This approach will correctly handle cases where multiple coins of the same value can be used and will be more efficient for large inputs.",
